      "slug": "waec-french-1-section-a-comprehension-1-this-is-designed-to-test-candidates-ability-to-read-and-understand-st-08c758364e",
      "topic": "waec-french-1-section-a-comprehension",
      "name": "This is designed to test candidates’ ability to read and understand standard written documents in French. Two passages, each of about 150 words, will be provided, and a total of five short questions will be set on each. The questions in this section will be multiple-choice questions only. Candidates will be required to answer all questions",
      "order": 1,
      "objectives": []
    },
